    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_otherDialogues.Array.data[1]'
      value: Les dispositifs dans les grottes sont pratiques pour atteindre le fond.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_otherDialogues.Array.data[2]'
      value: Le fond de quoi?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_otherDialogues.Array.data[3]'
      value: Le fond de la grotte, enfin.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[0]'
      value: ' '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[1]'
      value: You're probably wondering why there are so much inhabitants.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[2]'
      value: And so few houses, right?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[3]'
      value: Well, me too.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
